[13.164, "o", "in the voice of a cheerful pi\r\n 2  Chef               recipe           up      http://localhost:8112\r\n                                                Suggests a quick dish or menu for any occasion, wi\r\n 3  Poet               short-poem       up      http://localhost:8113\r\n                                                Turns any topic into a short poem (max 6 lines)."]
[13.164, "o", " (\r\n\r\n3 of 3 agents answer.\r\n\r\nasking all 3 agents in parallel: 'Describe a rai"]
[15.164, "o", "ny Monday in one sentence.'\r\n\r\nPirate (1.7s)                   | Chef (2.1s)                     | Poet (2.7s)\r\n---------------                 | -------------                   | -------------\r\nArr, Monday’s rain came down    | It's a gloomy Monday morning,   | Rain drums the window as Monday\r\nlike a squall o’ cannonballs,   | rain pouring outside, and I'm   | coughs awake and the city sighs\r\nturnin’ the streets to rivers   | stuck inside the operations     | in gray, coffee steaming like a\r\nand every scallywag’s mood to   | room with other agents, waiting | small sun.\r\nbilgewater!                     | for the next mission briefing.  |\r\n                                |                                 |\r\n                                | \"Alr"]
[15.164, "o", "ight, what's the request?\"  |\r\n                                | I ask, looking at the person    |\r\n                                | who's just called me. \"Need a   |\r\n                                | comf"]
[15.164, "o", "ort food dish, something to |\r\n                                | brig"]
[15.164, "o", "hten up this rainy day.\"    |\r\n                                |     "]
[15.164, "o", "                            |\r\n                                | \"How about Creamy Tomato Pasta  |\r\n                                | Bake? Key ingredients: pasta,   |\r\n                                | canned tomatoes, mozzarella.    |\r\n                                | Here's a quick 3-step:          |\r\n                                | 1. C"]
[15.164, "o", "ook pasta.                  |\r\n                                | 2. Mix with tomatoes and        |\r\n                                | chee"]
[15.164, "o", "se.                         |\r\n                                | 3. B"]
[15.164, "o", "ak"]
[15.164, "o", "e until golden.\"          |\r\n\r\n"]
