[22.093, "o", " (\r\n\r\n3 of 3 agents answer.\r\n\r\norchestrator model: gpt-5-nano - 3 agents as tools\r\ntask: Plan a tiny rooftop party: a snack to"]
[24.093, "o", " cook and a two-line toast.\r\n\r\n  -> Chef             'Suggest a quick snack to cook for a tiny rooftop party, with a 3-step method.'\r\n  -> Poet             'Turn this into a short two-line toa"]
