[28.17, "o", "Poet               2.1s  ok\r\n\r\n=== answer\r\nChef suggests a quick bruschetta snack: 1) Toast bread, 2) Top with a mix of diced tomatoes, garlic, and basil, 3) Drizzle with olive oil. \r\n\r\nPoet offers a two-line toast: \"To the tiny rooftop and the night that holds us tight. May our little spark outshine th"]
[28.17, "o", "e city and bless this light.\"\r\n"]
